    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d73-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d73-f1-content">
                <p>Source: Department of State, S/P–NSC Files: Lot 62 D 1, Soviet Satellites in
                    Eastern Europe. Top Secret. At its 280th meeting on March 22, in NSC Action No.
                    1530, the NSC directed the Planning Board to revise NSC 174; see <ref
                        target="#d50">Document 50</ref>. For text of NSC 174, see <ref
                        target="frus1952-54v08#pg_110"><hi rendition="#italic">Foreign
                            Relations</hi>, 1952–1954, vol. VIII, p. 110</ref>.</p>
                <p>A draft of NSC 5608 by Richard H. Davis of S/P, May 11, is in Department of
                    State, S/P Files: Lot 66 D 487, R. Davis chron. Regarding the Planning Board
                    revisions to NSC 5608, see <ref target="#d78">Document 78</ref>. The NSC
                    discussed NSC 5608 on July 12; see <ref target="#d79">Document 79</ref>. It was
                    approved as NSC 5608/1 on July 18; see <ref target="#d80">Document 80</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d73-f2" n="2" xml:id="d73-f2-content">
                <p>For text of NSC 5505/1, see <ref target="frus1955-57v24#pg_3">vol. XXIV, p.
                        3</ref>.</p>
            </note>
